# MoEStream persists learned tuning here. Both files are plain TSV.
#
#   tuning.tsv   <model file>  <frac>   <n_expert:bytes_per_slot>
#   ubatch.tsv   <model file>  <frac>   <ubatch>  <prefill tok/s>
#
# ubatch rows carry the frac they were measured at because the two interact:
# on Ornith-35B the best ubatch is 1024 at frac=0.25 but 2048 at frac=0.15.
# When frac moves, the old rows stop matching and the candidates are re-measured.
#
# Delete a file to start the search over. The contents are machine- and
# workload-specific, so they are not distributed.
